DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260103
SUMMARY:Obligatory Abstinence
DESCRIPTION:A day of complete abstinence from flesh meat. Every Friday is a
  penitential day (can. 1250-1251)\; outside Lent the episcopal conference 
 may substitute another penance.
END:VEVENT
