 l
DTSTAMP:20260101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260218
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260219
SUMMARY:Ash Wednesday (Obligatory Complete Fast & Abstinence)
DESCRIPTION:Fast and complete abstinence: one full meal and two small meatl
 ess collations\, with no flesh meat. Ash Wednesday and Good Friday are the
  Church's universal days of fast and abstinence (Code of Canon Law\, can. 
 1251-1252).
END:VEVENT
